STRASSEN(A, B)
1. If n is small (base case), multiply conventionally
2. Partition A into A11,A12,A21,A22 and B into B11,B12,B21,B22
3. M1=(A11+A22)(B11+B22)
4. M2=(A21+A22)B11
5. M3=A11(B12-B22)
6. M4=A22(B21-B11)
7. M5=(A11+A12)B22
8. M6=(A21-A11)(B11+B12)
9. M7=(A12-A22)(B21+B22)
10. C11=M1+M4-M5+M7
11. C12=M3+M5
12. C21=M2+M4
13. C22=M1-M2+M3+M6
14. Join the four C blocks
